@startuml researchprocess
title Research Process

start

:Baseline System;
note right
2 microservices
- Saga pattern
- Async + sync interactions
end note

:Failure Tests;
note right
Measure:
- Cross-service data consistency
- Transaction completion rate
end note

:Enhanced System;
note right
Add CDC + durable workflows layer
end note

:Repeat Failure Tests;
note right
Compare metrics
end note

:Analysis;
note right
Identify patterns,
integration constraints,
and operational tradeoffs
end note

' Repeat Failure Tests --> Analysis
' Analysis --> Failure Tests

stop
@enduml